### WebSocket Connection Test
### Note: This file is for documentation. Use a WebSocket client like wscat or browser console

### Connection URL via API Gateway (Recommended)
# ws://localhost:29000/ws/presence?token=YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

### Connection URL direct to User Service (For testing)
# ws://localhost:8001/ws/presence?token=YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

### Connection URL (with Authorization header - if client supports)
# ws://localhost:29000/ws/presence
# Header: Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

### After connecting, send heartbeat message:
# {"type": "heartbeat"}

### Expected response:
# {"type": "pong", "timestamp": 1234567890}

### Test Steps:
# 1. Get JWT token from login endpoint
# 2. Connect to WebSocket using the token
# 3. Send heartbeat message every 20 seconds
# 4. Verify online status via GET /api/v1/referral/friends

